        <headline>Gale Warning issued September 25 at 5:10AM AKDT until September 26 at 5:00AM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK</headline>
        <description>Offshore Waters Forecast for the Bering Sea

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TODAY...W wind 25 to 40 kt. Seas 15 to 25 ft. Rain showers.
.TONIGHT...W wind 20 to 35 kt. Seas 12 to 20 ft. Rain showers.
.SAT...W wind 15 to 30 kt. Seas 10 to 16 ft.
.SAT NIGHT...NW wind 15 to 25 kt. Seas 7 to 12 ft.
.SUN THROUGH TUE...W wind 15 to 25 kt. Seas 5 to 10 ft.
</description>
